# BuildKit-specific ignore file for deps/docker/Dockerfile.
# The build context is the repository root (build with
# `docker build -f deps/docker/Dockerfile .`); the image only needs
# the dependency build scripts and the shared cmake helpers.
**
!/cmake/
!/deps/rules/
!/deps/docker/toolchain-check/
# ... but never the host's own build tree (ExternalProject clones+builds).
deps/rules/build/
